      "sequence_position": 5,
      "problem": "Find the cofactor of ${d}_{34}$ in \n$D=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -8 & 2 & 0 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 5 & 0 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 0 & -1 & -5 & 6 & -4 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 3 & 8 & 3 \\\\ 11 & 3 & 0 & -9 & 0\\end{aligned}].$",
      "worked_solution": "First, to get the minor of ${d}_{34}$, we remove the $3$rd row and $4$th column: \n\n$$\nD=[\\begin{aligned}0 & -8 & 2 & ∗ & -1 \\\\ 3 & 5 & 0 & ∗ & 1 \\\\ ∗ & ∗ & ∗ & 6 & ∗ \\\\ 4 & 0 & 3 & ∗ & 3 \\\\ 11 & 3 & 0 & ∗ & 0\\end{aligned}]\n$$\n\nSo, the minor is \n\n$$\n{M}_{34}=|\\begin{aligned}0 & -8 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 5 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 3 & 3 \\\\ 11 & 3 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}|.\n$$\n\nNow, the cofactor of ${d}_{34}$ is\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{C}_{34} & =(-1)^{3+4}{M}_{34} \\\\  & =-{M}_{34} \\\\  & =-|\\begin{aligned}0 & -8 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 5 & 0 & 1 \\\\ 4 & 0 & 3 & 3 \\\\ 11 & 3 & 0 & 0\\end{aligned}|.\\end{aligned}\n$$",
